        <enclosure url="https://pub-6c2349c9a8a4430bb975409e6cf2e4ae.r2.dev/NotesPlusPlus-1.1.79-to-1.1.81.delta" sparkle:deltaFrom="1.1.79" length="1004346" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="RTYja5njx/MQo/5mcZljkGxJkJl3ZU+72FQ8w2qFhtosrWTAZv7Y6pILgpRgv3LwPJj7HttOyBoq7WtMjv//Bg==" />
        <enclosure url="https://pub-6c2349c9a8a4430bb975409e6cf2e4ae.r2.dev/NotesPlusPlus-1.1.78-to-1.1.81.delta" sparkle:deltaFrom="1.1.78" length="1004882" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="808xKfORiNuAPRm4oCRmxEUq4+yWEIey27Iuh/hHeCR6Nn/ELbUdsbC5W+lrZHI/K4NiJ6Mx5DFD60K/VsG5Bw==" />
      </sparkle:deltas>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Notes ++ 1.1.81 — Smoother notes and focused practice&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- Choose Claude Sonnet 5 or Opus 5 for university AI. Older saved model preferences migrate automatically. The class answer bank prefers Claude 5 answers while older app versions can still generate answers.&lt;br/&gt;- Practice Weak Objectives builds a separate follow-up quiz from objectives missed in newly generated quizzes, preserving the original quiz and its results.&lt;br/&gt;- Smoother free-draw arrows and a quickly fading, tapered eraser trail. Choose partial-stroke or whole-stroke erasing; the selected mode persists.&lt;br/&gt;- Side notes scale with slides without changing text wrapping. Fixed screen-size notes remain an option in Settings → Drawing. Fixes disappearing text after zooming and scrolling and separates the note move and connector handles.&lt;br/&gt;- Pasted text adopts the note&amp;#x27;s formatting.&lt;br/&gt;- A Drawing settings tab includes an Apple Pencil / Sidecar option to hide drawing cursors. Search Settings to find options faster; university Claude enrollment is easier to find.&lt;br/&gt;- Reader action buttons stay on the right in narrower windows.&lt;br/&gt;- Opt into future beta releases from Settings → Updates. Stable updates remain available to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
